"When a post contains a URL, fetch and display its Open Graph preview "
"(title, image, description)."
msgstr "当动态中包含网址时，获取并显示其 Open Graph 预览（标题、图片、描述）。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1105
msgid "Enable emoji picker"
msgstr "启用表情选择器"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1107
msgid "Show the emoji picker button in the post composer and comment editor."
msgstr "在动态编辑器和评论编辑器中显示表情选择按钮。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1114
msgid "Show new-posts indicator"
msgstr "显示新动态提示"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1116
msgid ""
"Show a \"new posts\" pill on the activity feed when fresh posts arrive. "
"While the feed tab is open it checks for new posts about once a minute "
"(paused when the tab is hidden); turn this off to stop those background "
"checks entirely. Developers can tune the cadence with the "
"buddynext_feed_new_count_interval filter."
msgstr ""
"当有新动态时，在动态页面上显示“有新动态”提示。动态标签页打开时，约每分钟检查一次新动态（标签页隐藏时暂停）；关闭此项可完全停止这些后台检查。开发者可以"
"通过 buddynext_feed_new_count_interval 过滤器调整检查频率。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1123
msgid "Close the edit window after a while"
msgstr "编辑时限到期后关闭编辑"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1124
msgid "Post edit window (minutes)"
msgstr "动态编辑时限（分钟）"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1127
msgid "How many minutes after posting a member can edit their post."
msgstr "成员发布动态后可以编辑的时间（分钟）。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1134
msgid "Members-only teaser length (%)"
msgstr "仅限成员可见内容的预览长度（%）"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1142
msgid ""
"How much of a members-only post a non-member sees as a preview, as a "
"percentage of its length. Capped at 95% so the gate always keeps something "
"back; 0 shows only the lock notice. The preview is never shorter than a few "
"words."
msgstr "非成员看到的仅限成员动态的预览内容占全文的百分比。上限为 95%，确保始终保留部分内容不展示；设为 0 则只显示锁定提示。预览内容至少包含几个词。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1162
msgid "Ask for a note when connecting"
msgstr "添加好友时要求填写附言"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1176
msgid ""
"Off (default): one click sends the connection request, like Facebook. On: "
"the member is asked to add a short note with their request, like LinkedIn - "
"and the note is shown to the recipient in their connection-request inbox, "
"next to Accept and Decline."
msgstr ""
"关闭（默认）：点击一次即可发送好友请求，与 Facebook 相同。开启：要求成员在请求中附上简短的附言，与 LinkedIn "
"相同，附言会显示在接收方的好友请求收件箱中，位于“接受”和“拒绝”按钮旁边。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1195
msgid "Who can message members"
msgstr "谁可以给成员发消息"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1197
msgid ""
"Direct messages need WPMediaVerse. Activate it to set who can message "
"members."
msgstr "私信功能需要 WPMediaVerse。启用后即可设置谁可以给成员发消息。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1203
#. translators: %s: the site-wide "who can message you" level, e.g. "Everyone".
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Set in WPMediaVerse: %s. Members can choose this or stricter in their "
"privacy settings."
msgstr "在 WPMediaVerse 中设置：%s。成员可以在隐私设置中选择此级别或更严格的级别。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1208 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2626
msgid "Change in WPMediaVerse"
msgstr "在 WPMediaVerse 中更改"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1230
msgid ""
"Choose which reactions members can use on posts and comments, including "
"your custom reactions. If you untick them all, every reaction stays on: to "
"switch reactions off, use Platform → Features."
msgstr ""
"选择成员可在动态和评论上使用的表情回应，包括您自定义的表情回应。如果全部取消勾选，则所有表情回应都会保持开启；如需关闭表情回应，请前往“平台 → "
"功能”。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1233
msgid ""
"Reactions are turned off under Platform → Features. Enable the Reactions "
"feature there to choose which emoji members can use."
msgstr "表情回应已在“平台 → 功能”中关闭。请在该处启用表情回应功能，以选择成员可使用的表情。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1267
msgid "Creation & limits"
msgstr "创建与限制"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1273
msgid "Who can create spaces"
msgstr "谁可以创建空间"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1276 includes/Spaces/CoreSpaceFields.php:295
msgid "Any member"
msgstr "任何成员"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1279
msgid "Restricting to admins prevents members from creating unmoderated spaces."
msgstr "限制为仅管理员可创建，可防止成员创建未经审核的空间。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1287
msgid "Cap how many spaces a member can create"
msgstr "限制成员可创建的空间数量"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1288
msgid "Max spaces per member"
msgstr "每位成员可创建的最多空间数"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1290
msgid "Maximum number of spaces a single member can create. Admins are exempt."
msgstr "单个成员可创建的最多空间数量。管理员不受此限制。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1297
msgid "Allow sub-spaces"
msgstr "允许子空间"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1300
msgid ""
"Let space owners create spaces nested inside their own. Turn off to keep "
"every space top-level."
msgstr "允许空间所有者在自己的空间内创建子空间。关闭后，所有空间都将保持为顶级空间。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1308
msgid "Cap sub-spaces per space"
msgstr "限制每个空间的子空间数量"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1309
msgid "Max sub-spaces per space"
msgstr "每个空间的子空间上限数"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1311
msgid ""
"Maximum number of sub-spaces a space owner can create inside their space. "
"Applies only while Allow sub-spaces is on."
msgstr "空间所有者可在其空间内创建的子空间数量上限。仅在启用“允许子空间”时生效。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1318
msgid "New-space defaults"
msgstr "新建空间默认设置"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1324
msgid "Default visibility for new spaces"
msgstr "新建空间的默认可见性"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1333
msgid ""
"The visibility a space starts with when created. Owners can still change it "
"per space."
msgstr "空间创建时的初始可见性。所有者仍可为每个空间单独修改。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1340
msgid "Default category for new spaces"
msgstr "新建空间的默认分类"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1353
msgid ""
"New spaces without a chosen category are filed here. Manage the list under "
"Spaces → Directory → Categories."
msgstr "未选择分类的新空间将归入此处。请在“空间 → 目录 → 分类”下管理分类列表。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1387
msgid "Auto-moderation thresholds"
msgstr "自动审核阈值"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1393
msgid "Auto-hide after N reports"
msgstr "被举报 N 次后自动隐藏"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1405
msgid ""
"Content is hidden automatically once it reaches this number of reports, and "
"waits in the moderation queue. Reports from accounts younger than 7 days do "
"not count, and an automatic flag (a new member's post, a duplicate, a rule) "
"counts as one. Set to 0 to turn automatic hiding off."
msgstr ""
"内容被举报次数达到此数值后将自动隐藏，并进入审核队列等待处理。注册未满 7 "
"天的账户所做的举报不计入在内，自动标记（新成员的动态、重复动态、规则触发）计为一次举报。设为 0 可关闭自动隐藏。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1412
msgid "Email admins when the queue builds up"
msgstr "审核队列积压时通知管理员"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1413
msgid "Queue alert threshold"
msgstr "队列提醒阈值"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1420
msgid ""
"Send a daily email to admins when the moderation queue exceeds this many "
"unreviewed items."
msgstr "当审核队列中未处理的内容超过此数量时，每天向管理员发送一封电子邮件。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1427
msgid "Strike system"
msgstr "违规记录系统"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1433
msgid "Strikes before warning"
msgstr "发出警告前的违规次数"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1436
msgid "A warning email is sent to the member after this many active strikes."
msgstr "成员有效违规记录达到此数量后，将向其发送警告邮件。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1443
msgid "Strikes before suspension"
msgstr "停权前的违规次数"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1446
msgid "The member is automatically suspended after this many active strikes."
msgstr "成员有效违规记录达到此数量后，将被自动停权。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1453
msgid "Permanently ban after enough strikes"
msgstr "违规达到一定次数后永久封禁"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1454
msgid "Strikes before permanent ban"
msgstr "永久封禁前的违规次数"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1457
msgid "The member is permanently banned after this many lifetime strikes."
msgstr "成员累计违规记录达到此数量后，将被永久封禁。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1464
msgid "Content safeguards"
msgstr "内容防护"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1471 includes/Spaces/CoreSpaceFields.php:198
#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-moderation.php:78
msgid "Banned words"
msgstr "禁用词"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1472
msgid ""
"One word or phrase per line. A post using any of them is rejected. Whole "
"words only, so \"art\" does not block \"start\" or \"particle\". Add * to "
"catch variants: \"spam*\" also blocks \"spammer\"."
msgstr ""
"每行一个词语或短语。含有任一词语的动态将被拒绝。仅按整词匹配，因此“art”不会屏蔽“start”或“particle”。添加 * "
"可匹配变体：“spam*”也会屏蔽“spammer”。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1480
msgid "Banned hashtags"
msgstr "禁用话题标签"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1481
msgid ""
"One hashtag per line (without the # sign). Posts using these tags are "
"rejected."
msgstr "每行一个话题标签（不含 # 符号）。使用这些标签的动态将被拒绝。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1489
msgid "Blocked link domains"
msgstr "屏蔽的链接域名"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1490
msgid ""
"One domain per line (for example spam.example.com). Posts linking to these "
"domains are rejected."
msgstr "每行一个域名（例如 spam.example.com）。包含这些域名链接的动态将被拒绝。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1498
msgid "Blocked IP addresses"
msgstr "屏蔽的 IP 地址"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1500
msgid ""
"One IP address per line (IPv4 or IPv6). These addresses cannot sign in, "
"register, post, or comment - including on accounts they already hold. Your "
"own address cannot be added. Invalid entries are dropped on save."
msgstr ""
"每行一个 IP 地址（IPv4 或 IPv6）。这些地址无法登录、注册、发布动态或评论，包括已拥有账户的情况。无法添加您自己的 IP "
"地址。保存时将删除无效条目。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1507
msgid "Rate-limit posting"
msgstr "限制发布频率"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1508
msgid "Post rate limit (per minute)"
msgstr "发布频率限制（每分钟）"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1511
msgid "Maximum number of posts a member can create per minute."
msgstr "成员每分钟可发布动态的最大数量。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1518
msgid "Rate-limit commenting"
msgstr "限制评论频率"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1519
msgid "Comment rate limit (per minute)"
msgstr "评论频率限制（每分钟）"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1522
msgid "Maximum number of comments a member can post per minute."
msgstr "成员每分钟可发表评论的最大数量。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1529
msgid "Flag duplicate posts"
msgstr "标记重复动态"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1530
msgid "Duplicate post window (minutes)"
msgstr "重复动态检测时间窗口（分钟）"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1533
msgid ""
"When the member has already posted identical content within this many "
"minutes, the post publishes immediately and files a report in Moderation > "
"Reports."
msgstr "若成员在此分钟数内已发布过相同内容，该动态将立即发布，并在“审核 > 举报”中生成一条举报记录。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1540
msgid "Flag posts from new members"
msgstr "标记新成员的动态"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1541
msgid "New member review threshold"
msgstr "新成员审核门槛"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1544
msgid ""
"Posts by members with fewer than this many published posts publish "
"immediately and file a report in Moderation > Reports."
msgstr "已发布动态数少于此数值的成员,其动态将立即发布,并在“管理 > 举报”中生成一条举报记录。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1561
msgid "Default notification preferences"
msgstr "默认通知偏好设置"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1569
msgid "Notify members by default when someone follows them."
msgstr "默认在有人关注成员时通知该成员。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1578
msgid "Notify members by default when they receive a connection request."
msgstr "默认在成员收到好友请求时通知该成员。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1585
msgid "Reaction on post"
msgstr "动态表情回应"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1587
msgid "Notify members by default when someone reacts to their post."
msgstr "默认在有人对成员的动态表情回应时通知该成员。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1594
msgid "Comment on post"
msgstr "动态评论"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1596
msgid "Notify members by default when someone comments on their post."
msgstr "默认在有人评论成员的动态时通知该成员。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1603
msgid "@mention in post or comment"
msgstr "在动态或评论中提及"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1605
msgid "Notify members by default when they are mentioned."
msgstr "默认在成员被提及时通知该成员。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1612
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationMessageService.php:655
msgid "New space member"
msgstr "新空间成员"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1614
msgid "Notify space owners by default when someone joins their space."
msgstr "默认在有人加入空间时通知空间管理者。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1621
msgid "Email digest"
msgstr "邮件摘要"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1627
msgid "Digest emails"
msgstr "摘要邮件"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1660
msgid "Disabled: no digest emails"
msgstr "已禁用:不发送摘要邮件"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1662
msgid ""
"Whether BuddyNext sends digests of unread notifications at all. Each member "
"chooses daily or weekly in their own notification preferences."
msgstr "BuddyNext 是否发送未读通知的摘要邮件。每位成员可在各自的通知偏好设置中选择每日或每周接收。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1669
msgid "Admin alerts"
msgstr "管理员提醒"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1676
msgid "Admin alert email"
msgstr "管理员提醒邮箱"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1679
msgid ""
"Receives daily alerts when the moderation queue or pending registration "
"count is high. Defaults to WordPress admin email."
msgstr "当待审核内容或待处理注册数量较多时,每日接收提醒邮件。默认为 WordPress 管理员邮箱。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1696
msgid "Sender identity"
msgstr "发件人信息"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1703
msgid "From name"
msgstr "发件人名称"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1705
msgid ""
"Display name shown in the \"From:\" field of all community emails. Defaults "
"to your site name."
msgstr "显示在所有社区邮件“发件人”字段中的名称。默认为您的网站名称。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1713
msgid "From address"
msgstr "发件人邮箱"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1716
msgid ""
"Sending address for all BuddyNext system emails. Defaults to your admin "
"email; use a verified domain for best deliverability."
msgstr "用于发送所有 BuddyNext 系统邮件的地址。默认为您的管理员邮箱;为获得最佳送达率,请使用已验证的域名。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1724
msgid "Reply-To address"
msgstr "回复地址"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1726
msgid ""
"Optional. If set, replies to community emails go here instead of the From "
"address. Applied to every BuddyNext email."
msgstr "可选。若设置,社区邮件的回复将发送至此地址,而非发件人邮箱。适用于所有 BuddyNext 邮件。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1733
msgid "Email footer"
msgstr "邮件页脚"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1740
msgid "Footer text"
msgstr "页脚文字"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1741
msgid ""
"Appended to the bottom of every BuddyNext email. Plain text, plus the "
"placeholders {{site_name}}, {{site_url}}, and {{current_year}}."
msgstr ""
"添加到每封 BuddyNext 邮件底部。支持纯文本,以及占位符 {{site_name}}、{{site_url}} 和 "
"{{current_year}}。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1757
msgid "Open: anyone can register"
msgstr "开放:任何人都可注册"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1758
msgid "Invite Only: requires an invitation"
msgstr "仅限邀请:需要邀请才能注册"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1759
msgid "Admin Approval: admin reviews each request"
msgstr "管理员审核:由管理员审核每个申请"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1760
msgid "Closed: nobody can create an account"
msgstr "关闭:任何人都无法创建账户"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1773
msgid ""
"Restricted: they can look around, but cannot post or comment until they "
"confirm"
msgstr "受限:可以浏览,但需确认后才能发布动态或评论"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1774
msgid "Full: they cannot use the community at all until they confirm"
msgstr "完全限制:确认前无法使用社区的任何功能"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1785
msgid "Nobody: members can still switch it on themselves"
msgstr "无人:成员仍可自行开启"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1786
msgid "Administrators"
msgstr "管理员"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1787
msgid "Administrators and editors"
msgstr "管理员和编辑"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1788
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:31
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:52
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:56
msgid "Everyone"
msgstr "所有人"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1808 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2689
msgid "Registration settings"
msgstr "注册设置"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1816 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2704
#: includes/Onboarding/SetupWizard.php:891
msgid "Registration mode"
msgstr "注册模式"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1817 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2707
msgid "Controls who can create a new account on your community."
msgstr "控制谁可以在您的社区中创建新账户。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1825 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2752
#: includes/Onboarding/SetupWizard.php:920
msgid "Require email verification"
msgstr "要求验证电子邮件"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1826
msgid ""
"Ask new members to confirm their email address. Choose how strictly it is "
"enforced below."
msgstr "要求新成员确认其电子邮件地址。请在下方选择验证的严格程度。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1835 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2763
msgid "How strictly to enforce verification"
msgstr "验证的严格程度"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1836
msgid ""
"Restricted (recommended): members can look around but cannot post or "
"comment until they confirm. Full: they cannot use the community at all "
"until they confirm."
msgstr "受限（推荐）：成员可以浏览，但在确认之前无法发布动态或发表评论。完全：成员在确认之前无法使用社区的任何功能。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1844 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2718
msgid "Require members to accept your terms"
msgstr "要求成员接受您的条款"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1845 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2719
msgid "Shows a consent checkbox on every sign-up route. On by default."
msgstr "在每个注册途径上显示同意复选框。默认开启。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1853 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2729
msgid "Ask new members for their name"
msgstr "要求新成员填写姓名"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1854 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2730
msgid ""
"On by default. This is the name other members see. Turn it off only if your "
"community wants handles rather than names."
msgstr "默认开启。这是其他成员看到的名称。仅当您的社区希望使用昵称而非真实姓名时才关闭。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1862 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2736
msgid "Let members choose their own username"
msgstr "允许成员自行选择用户名"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1863 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2737
msgid ""
"Off by default: a username is generated from their email so nobody has to "
"invent one to join, and they can change it later in Settings. Turn this on "
"to ask for one at sign-up."
msgstr "默认关闭：系统会根据电子邮件自动生成用户名，因此无需额外创建即可加入，成员之后可在设置中修改。开启此选项后，注册时将要求填写用户名。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1871 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2743
msgid "Also allow the WordPress sign-up form"
msgstr "同时允许 WordPress 注册表单"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1872 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2744
msgid ""
"Off by default: wp-login.php sign-ups are sent to your BuddyNext sign-up "
"page instead. Turn this on if another plugin relies on the WordPress form. "
"It is protected by your settings either way."
